  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There is no defined procedure by which updates can be made to the LDP Test Suite (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/w3c/ldp-testsuite)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/w3c/ldp-testsuite)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ". This is leading to bit rot and a less and less usable piece of software. We need to work with LDPNext to find a way forward for that tool.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
