  "description": "<p>There is no defined procedure by which updates can be made to the LDP Test Suite (<a href=\"https://github.com/w3c/ldp-testsuite\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/w3c/ldp-testsuite</a>). This is leading to bit rot and a less and less usable piece of software. We need to work with LDPNext to find a way forward for that tool.</p>",
